# Exact decimal evaluation accepts the 100-digit boundary.
# Run: target/release/litex -lang en -strict -f examples/stmt_nodes/command/eval_exact_decimal_budget.lit
# The following rejected input previously reported only "Exact evaluation failed."
# eval 10^100
# It now reports category exact_decimal_budget and the 100-digit ceiling.
# Executable rejection: examples/negative/closed_exact_elementary_calculation/exact_decimal_digit_budget.lit

eval 10^99
eval 10^49 * 10^50
eval factorial(69)
10^100 = 10^100
